lore = "The civilization tier (X3): fast-forward folds the player-choice ledger at sky-day cadence. A day of drift is a rounding error here; what players chose is the only state worth folding, and the Concord Chronicle is already its day-scale ledger. Cosmic calibration declared: SI-exact c (299792458 m/s), the measured expansion rate H0 (67.4 km/s/Mpc, Planck 2018), the origin (unix 1789861412 -- the first commit: the universe began when its code did), and the Rest frame (three facilities at trilateral rest -- the center is wound, not found). The outer limit needs no wall: the horizon is how far light has traveled since the origin, and it grows at exactly c."
